## Custom *Toxoplasma* ApiAP2 motif reference

A small TgApiAP2 motif reference was generated from experimentally reported binding sequences for Tomtom comparison.

```bash
iupac2meme -dna CAGTGT | \
awk '/^MOTIF / {$0="MOTIF TgAP2IX-9 CAGTGT"} {print}' \
> AP2IX-9_named.meme

iupac2meme -dna ACCCCCCT | \
awk '/^MOTIF / {$0="MOTIF TgAP2IV-4 ACCCCCCT"} {print}' \
> AP2IV-4_named.meme

iupac2meme -dna GCTAGC | \
awk '/^MOTIF / {$0="MOTIF TgAP2XI-5 GCTAGC"} {print}' \
> AP2XI-5_named.meme

iupac2meme -dna YGCATGCR | \
awk '/^MOTIF / {$0="MOTIF TgAP2XII-8_TRP2-like YGCATGCR"} {print}' \
> AP2XII-8_named.meme
```

Merge:

```bash
meme2meme \
  AP2IX-9_named.meme \
  AP2IV-4_named.meme \
  AP2XI-5_named.meme \
  AP2XII-8_named.meme \
  > Toxoplasma_ApiAP2_known_motifs.meme
```

Check:

```bash
grep '^MOTIF ' Toxoplasma_ApiAP2_known_motifs.meme
```

The database can be expanded as additional experimentally supported TgApiAP2 motifs become available.
